<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Ksubi Jeans!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">DeeKay, lilbubblegum, Letoa</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Ksubi Jeans!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3gd189LrWml7YIpS4YeCZi</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">4 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ksubi Jeans! Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hehehehehe</p><p ttm:agent="v1">KILLHEEN, are you mad?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: DeeKay,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">lilbubblegum</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ksubi jeans, white tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got the stacks on racks on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull up, Maserati, Versace</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She let me hit with that body</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She gotta stop me, no thotty</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because I pull out, no Gaudy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ksubi jeans, white tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got the stacks on racks on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull up, Maserati, Versace (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She let me hit with that body (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Tsaha</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She gotta stop me, no thotty (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wait, uh, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because I pull out, no Gaudy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: lilbubblegum]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">White tee, no Peep</p><p ttm:agent="v1">, shawty for the team (Tsaha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She gon' throw it back, so I hit it then I leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I ain't talkin' cabbage, but I really want 'em greens</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I be all up in her walls, now we lookin' like some cream</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You gon' talk it, you know that we gon' walk it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Versace on my neck, couple racks in my pocket</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm blowin' up like a rocket, they really be tryna stop it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm drippin' just like a faucet, she all up inside her cockpit (Tsaha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We gon' slide if they really wanna die, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">.223s and a couple .45s, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I am not no plumber but I gave your girl some pipe, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ivy on my neck, it just glisten like the sky, ayy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I said, "Adiós, I'm goin' to Tokyo"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Couple Asian baddies with a fatty in the studio</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't need no groupie ho</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I be goin' three and o</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Shawty want my nuts and I ain't talkin' 'bout pistachio[Chorus: DeeKay,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Letoa</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ksubi jeans, white tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got the stacks on racks on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull up, Maserati, Versace</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She let me hit with that body</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She gotta stop me, no thotty</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because I pull out, no Gaudy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ksubi jeans, white tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got the stacks on racks on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull up, Maserati, Versace</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She let me hit with that body</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She gotta stop me, no thotty (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because I pull out, no Gaudy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2: Letoa]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Shawty pull up and she do what I say so (Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gucci and Gabbana 'cause she know I got the peso (I got the peso)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull up in a Ghost, no, that's no Halo (Halo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This is TF2 to the way I push the payload</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Too much talk-talk, watch your boy get rocked-rocked</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull up to your spot-spot, watch the choppa blow-blow</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My jeans, they Ksubi, all these bitches groupies (Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Talkin' like they knew me (Yeah, yeah), they don't know the new me (Yeah, yeah, okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All this fuckin' guala on me, yeah, it made me want some more shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pray that I got the keys (Got the keys), I hope I make it through the motion</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Shawty want some of me because, bitch, I am Samoan</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And she follow my lead 'cause I got gave the bitch a potion</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And they love the fit, whole lot of other shit (Whole lot of other shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Tell me that she love me, but I wanna hit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don't wanna make a scene (Goddamn), your shit is make-believe (Goddamn, goddamn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">After I leave, these bitches hatin' me, like, goddamn[Chorus: DeeKay]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ksubi jeans, white tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got the stacks on racks on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull up, Maserati, Versace</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She let me hit with that body</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She gotta stop me, no thotty</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because I pull out, no Gaudy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ksubi jeans, white tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got the stacks on racks on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull up, Maserati, Versace</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She let me hit with that body</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She gotta stop me, no thotty</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because I pull out, no Gaudy</p></div></body></tt>